+## Runs / Eval Jobs (new)
+
+This patch adds a minimal "Runs" plane using Kubernetes Jobs:
+
+1) Create an eval run (creates K8s Job + Run row):
+   POST /v1/runs/eval
+
+2) Poll run status (reconciles from K8s when possible):
+   GET /v1/runs/{run_id}
+
+Configure the default eval image:
+- `AEGIS_EVAL_IMAGE=<your-eval-image>`
+
+Your eval image can:
+- download the model artifact
+- run evaluation
+- write results back to object storage
+- optionally call back into Aegis to set eval_status=pass/fail (future patch)
